    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Repeat PCL-5 and PHQ-9 at six and twelve weeks to monitor symptom change. Guideline: VA/DoD Clinical Practice Guideline for Management of Posttraumatic Stress Disorder and Acute Stress Disorder (2023) [S]</item><item>Create a collaborative safety and lethal-means plan with crisis resources, including the 988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline, without describing methods or historical weapon details in patient instructions. Guideline: VA/DoD Clinical Practice Guideline for Management of Posttraumatic Stress Disorder and Acute Stress Disorder (2023) [S]</item><item>Review sleep routine, stimulus control, and non-pharmacologic insomnia strategies; reassess before adding medication. Guideline: VA/DoD Clinical Practice Guideline for Management of Posttraumatic Stress Disorder and Acute Stress Disorder (2023) [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
